    dm:pageAccuracyNote "The notes say the page wrongly cites a case the donor lost in support." ;
    dm:citedForOpposite "Ferguson v. Commissioner, 174 F.3d 997 (9th Cir. 1999), read 2026-11-21: the government won. Once more than half the shares were tendered the stock had ripened into a right to cash, and the gifts came after that, so the donors were taxed on the gain. The Tax Court opinion was not read separately." ;
    dm:citedAuthorityRead true .

