:S4_137 a dm:StoryCase ;
    dm:storyId "S4-137" ;
    dm:storySection "4.13.3" ;
    dm:storyKind "example" ;
    dm:pageSays "Non-qualified options left to charity by beneficiary designation give an estate deduction, and the charity's IRD goes untaxed." ;
    dm:citesAuthority "2055" ;
    dm:pageOutcome dm:Allow ;
    dm:storyScope dm:OutsideModel ;
    dm:outsideCategory dm:TransferTaxArithmetic ;
    dm:outsideReason "bequest of stock options" ;
    dm:pageAccuracyNote "The notes say the options were really worth less than stated, and that ISOs are not truly IRD." ;
    dm:authorityUnread "26 USC 421(c) and 422(c)(3), on whether an incentive option left at death is income in respect of a decedent; not read. Outside the checks." .

:S4_138 a dm:StoryCase ;
    dm:storyId "S4-138" ;
    dm:storySection "4.13.4" ;
    dm:storyKind "example" ;
    dm:pageSays "Options left to a testamentary unitrust for a son give the estate a remainder deduction, with the spread reaching the son as tier-1 income." ;
    dm:citesAuthority "2055" ;
    dm:pageOutcome dm:Allow ;
    dm:storyScope dm:GradedByModel ;
    dm:storyGift :S4_138_gift ;
    dm:pageAccuracyNote "The notes say the trust's net value is half what the page implies unless it had other cash." ;
    dm:authorityUnread "No authority settles this: the flag is arithmetic on the trust's net value, which the checks do not grade." .
:S4_138_gift a dm:PlannedGift ;
    dm:giftVehicle dm:CharitableRemainderUnitrust ; dm:deductionAllowed true ; dm:deductionFor dm:RemainderInterest ;
    # assumed: a 5 percent payout; the page does not give the rate
    dm:unitrustPercent "5"^^xsd:decimal ;
    # assumed: remainder at least 10 percent; the page treats the trust as qualifying
    dm:remainderValuePercent "30"^^xsd:decimal .

:S4_139 a dm:StoryCase ;
    dm:storyId "S4-139" ;
    dm:storySection "4.14.1" ;
    dm:storyKind "example" ;
    dm:pageSays "An S corporation's gift of appreciated stock passes a full-value deduction to shareholders, who reduce basis only by their share of cost." ;
    dm:citesAuthority "1367(a)(2) (PATH rule, per notes); 1361" ;
    dm:pageOutcome dm:Allow ;
    dm:storyScope dm:OutsideModel ;
    dm:outsideCategory dm:DeductionArithmetic ;
    dm:outsideReason "S corporation pass-through deduction" .

:S4_140 a dm:StoryCase ;
    dm:storyId "S4-140" ;
    dm:storySection "4.14.2" ;
    dm:storyKind "example" ;
    dm:pageSays "A charity holding S stock pays UBIT on its income share and sale gain; a foundation also faces excess business holdings limits." ;
    dm:citesAuthority "1361(c)(6); 4943; Caracci (118 T.C. No. 25)" ;
    dm:pageOutcome dm:NeedsCounsel ;
    dm:storyScope dm:OutsideModel ;
    dm:outsideCategory dm:CharityOperations ;
    dm:outsideReason "charity as S shareholder" ;
    dm:pageAccuracyNote "The notes say unrelated business income follows K-1 income, not distributions." ;
    dm:authorityUnread "26 USC 512(e), how a charity's share of S corporation income is taxed; not read. Outside the checks." .

:S4_141 a dm:StoryCase ;
    dm:storyId "S4-141" ;
    dm:storySection "4.14.3" ;
    dm:storyKind "example" ;
    dm:pageSays "S corporation shares put in a remainder trust end the S election, since the trust is not an eligible shareholder." ;
    dm:citesAuthority "1361(e); PLR 8922014" ;
    dm:pageOutcome dm:Block ;
    dm:storyScope dm:GradedByModel ;
    dm:storyGift :S4_141_gift .
:S4_141_gift a dm:PlannedGift ;
    dm:giftVehicle dm:CharitableRemainderUnitrust ; dm:deductionAllowed true ; dm:deductionFor dm:RemainderInterest ;
    # assumed: a 5 percent payout; the page does not give the rate
    dm:unitrustPercent "5"^^xsd:decimal ;
    # assumed: remainder at least 10 percent; the page treats the trust as qualifying
    dm:remainderValuePercent "30"^^xsd:decimal ;
    dm:holdsSCorpStock true .

:S4_142 a dm:StoryCase ;
    dm:storyId "S4-142" ;
    dm:storySection "4.14.4" ;
    dm:storyKind "private letter ruling" ;
    dm:pageSays "A discounted option on S stock was first approved, then withdrawn; the IRS now refuses favorable rulings and treats the option as a partial interest." ;
    dm:citesAuthority "PLR 9240017; PLR 9417005; PLR 9501004" ;
    dm:pageOutcome dm:NeedsCounsel ;
    dm:storyScope dm:OutsideModel ;
    dm:outsideCategory dm:VehicleNotYetModeled ;
    dm:outsideReason "option on S stock" .

:S4_143 a dm:StoryCase ;
    dm:storyId "S4-143" ;
    dm:storySection "4.14.4" ;
    dm:storyKind "example" ;
    dm:pageSays "An owner grants a remainder trust a nominal option on S stock, which it sells to a public charity; the owner expects an audit challenge." ;
    dm:citesAuthority "Reg. 1.170A-5(a)(3) (per notes)" ;
    dm:pageOutcome dm:NeedsCounsel ;
    dm:storyScope dm:GradedByModel ;
    dm:storyGift :S4_143_gift ;
    dm:gapNote "No check models an option as a partial interest whose deduction waits for exercise." ;
    dm:pageAccuracyNote "The notes say no deduction arises until exercise and the exercising charity then holds S stock with full UBI, so it is not a recommendation." ;
    dm:authorityUnread "26 CFR 1.170A-5(a)(3) and Rev. Rul. 82-197 not read. The audit says the deduction waits for exercise and the exercising charity holds S stock with full unrelated business income." .
:S4_143_gift a dm:PlannedGift ;
    dm:giftVehicle dm:CharitableRemainderUnitrust ; dm:deductionAllowed true ; dm:deductionFor dm:RemainderInterest ;
    # assumed: a 5 percent payout; the page does not give the rate
    dm:unitrustPercent "5"^^xsd:decimal ;
    # assumed: remainder at least 10 percent; the page treats the trust as qualifying
    dm:remainderValuePercent "30"^^xsd:decimal ;
    # the trust holds an option, not the stock itself
    dm:holdsSCorpStock false .

:S4_144 a dm:StoryCase ;
    dm:storyId "S4-144" ;
    dm:storySection "4.14.5" ;
    dm:storyKind "example" ;
    dm:pageSays "An S corporation funds a 20-year unitrust with assets; the shareholder deducts a pro rata share and reduces basis by a share of the assets' basis." ;
    dm:citesAuthority "1366(d)(1); Reg. 1.337(d)-4; 1375; 1362(d)(3)" ;
    dm:pageOutcome dm:Allow ;
    dm:storyScope dm:GradedByModel ;
    dm:storyGift :S4_144_gift ;
    dm:pageAccuracyNote "The notes say the assets' fair market value is not given." .
:S4_144_gift a dm:PlannedGift ;
    dm:giftVehicle dm:CharitableRemainderUnitrust ; dm:deductionAllowed true ; dm:deductionFor dm:RemainderInterest ;
    # assumed: a 5 percent payout; the page does not give the rate
    dm:unitrustPercent "5"^^xsd:decimal ;
    # assumed: about 36 percent, the remainder of a 20-year 5 percent term
    dm:remainderValuePercent "36"^^xsd:decimal ;
    dm:holdsSCorpStock false ;
    # assumed: less than substantially all of the corporation's assets go in
    dm:counterparty :DonorCompany ; dm:vehicleAct dm:PayoutUnderTermsAct .

:S4_145 a dm:StoryCase ;
    dm:storyId "S4-145" ;
    dm:storySection "4.14.6" ;
    dm:storyKind "example" ;
    dm:pageSays "A sole owner revokes the S election and gives the C stock to a unitrust, getting a full-value deduction without UBI but later double tax." ;
    dm:citesAuthority "1362(g) (per notes)" ;
    dm:pageOutcome dm:Allow ;
    dm:storyScope dm:GradedByModel ;
    dm:storyGift :S4_145_gift ;
    dm:gapNote "No check tests a prearranged sale or anticipatory assignment of income, where a gift made after a sale is effectively agreed taxes the gain to the donor." ;
    dm:pageAccuracyNote "The notes add the 5-year wait before re-electing S, the 1 percent corporate floor and step-transaction risk." .
:S4_145_gift a dm:PlannedGift ;
    dm:giftVehicle dm:CharitableRemainderUnitrust ; dm:deductionAllowed true ; dm:deductionFor dm:RemainderInterest ;
    # assumed: a 5 percent payout; the page does not give the rate
    dm:unitrustPercent "5"^^xsd:decimal ;
    # assumed: remainder at least 10 percent; the page treats the trust as qualifying
    dm:remainderValuePercent "30"^^xsd:decimal ;
    dm:holdsSCorpStock false .

:S4_146 a dm:StoryCase ;
    dm:storyId "S4-146" ;
    dm:storySection "4.14.7" ;
    dm:storyKind "example" ;
    dm:pageSays "An S corporation leases assets to an unrelated lessee before giving them to a 20-year unitrust, so the trust gets only fixed rent." ;
    dm:citesAuthority "4946; 512(b)(3) (notes); Newhall" ;
    dm:pageOutcome dm:Allow ;
    dm:storyScope dm:GradedByModel ;
    dm:storyGift :S4_146_gift ;
    dm:gapNote "Covered since the audit pass by PG13 (personal-property rent)." ;
    dm:pageAccuracyNote "The notes say equipment rent is not excluded and the page's warning that UBTI disqualifies the trust is the pre-2007 rule." ;
    dm:authorityOutcome dm:NeedsCounsel ;
    dm:authorityBasis "26 USC 512(b)(3), 26 CFR 1.512(b)-1(c)(2) and 664(c)(2)(A), read 2026-11-21: equipment rent is not excluded rent unless incidental to a lease of real property, so the trust owes a 100 percent excise on it. The page's warning that the income disqualifies the trust is the rule before 2007." ;
    dm:authorityRead true .
:S4_146_gift a dm:PlannedGift ;
    dm:giftVehicle dm:CharitableRemainderUnitrust ; dm:deductionAllowed true ; dm:deductionFor dm:RemainderInterest ;
    # assumed: a 5 percent payout; the page does not give the rate
    dm:unitrustPercent "5"^^xsd:decimal ;
    # assumed: about 36 percent, the remainder of a 20-year 5 percent term
    dm:remainderValuePercent "36"^^xsd:decimal ;
    # regraded on primary law: the S corporation leases its equipment; the page gives no share
    # of the rent for real property, so PG13 fails closed
    dm:vehicleAct dm:LeaseAct ; dm:lessee :S4_146_lessee ; dm:counterparty :S4_146_lessee ;
    dm:rentDependsOnProfits false .

:S4_147 a dm:StoryCase ;
    dm:storyId "S4-147" ;
    dm:storySection "4.14.7" ;
    dm:storyKind "example" ;
    dm:pageSays "Use a short renewable lease if a sale of the trust's assets is coming; otherwise the lease should run as long as the trust." ;
    dm:citesAuthority "none" ;
    dm:pageOutcome dm:Allow ;
    dm:storyScope dm:GradedByModel ;
    dm:storyGift :S4_147_gift .
:S4_147_gift a dm:PlannedGift ;
    dm:giftVehicle dm:CharitableRemainderUnitrust ; dm:deductionAllowed true ; dm:deductionFor dm:RemainderInterest ;
    # assumed: a 5 percent payout; the page does not give the rate
    dm:unitrustPercent "5"^^xsd:decimal ;
    # assumed: about 36 percent, the remainder of a 20-year 5 percent term
    dm:remainderValuePercent "36"^^xsd:decimal ;
    # assumed: the lease keeps the trust's income to excluded rent
    dm:producesUBTI false .

:S4_148 a dm:StoryCase ;
    dm:storyId "S4-148" ;
    dm:storySection "4.14.9" ;
    dm:storyKind "example" ;
    dm:pageSays "Inherited S stock in a 20-year 7 percent non-grantor lead annuity trust electing ESBT status makes a small taxable gift and moves growth out of the estate." ;
    dm:citesAuthority "Reg. 1.641(c)-1(l), Ex. 4; 641(c)(2)(E) (notes)" ;
    dm:pageOutcome dm:Allow ;
    dm:storyScope dm:GradedByModel ;
    dm:storyGift :S4_148_gift ;
    dm:gapNote "No check tests the ESBT election that lets a lead trust hold S stock, and the trust's share of the company, needed for the 4943 test, is not given." ;
    dm:pageAccuracyNote "The notes say that since 2018 the S portion of an ESBT can deduct charitable payments under the individual 170 rules." .
:S4_148_gift a dm:PlannedGift ;
    dm:giftVehicle dm:FamilyLeadTrust ; dm:deductionAllowed true ; dm:deductionFor dm:IncomeInterest ;
    dm:incomeInterestForm dm:GuaranteedAnnuity ;
    # assumed: the page calls the taxable gift small, so the lead interest is most of the value
    dm:charitableIncomeValuePercent "90"^^xsd:decimal ;
    # assumed: a trustee unrelated to the donor; the page names none
    dm:giftTrustee :IndependentTrustee ;
    dm:leadBeneficiary :PublicCharity ;
    dm:holdsSCorpStock true .

:S4_149 a dm:StoryCase ;
    dm:storyId "S4-149" ;
    dm:storySection "4.14.9" ;
    dm:storyKind "example" ;
    dm:pageSays "S stock in a 10-year grantor lead trust gives a large up-front deduction, the donor taxed on trust income; the trust is an eligible S shareholder." ;
    dm:citesAuthority "1361(c)(2)(A)(i); PLRs 199936031, 199908002" ;
    dm:pageOutcome dm:Allow ;
    dm:storyScope dm:OutsideModel ;
    dm:outsideCategory dm:VehicleNotYetModeled ;
    dm:outsideReason "grantor lead trust" ;
    dm:pageAccuracyNote "The notes say the deduction is the present value of the charity's income interest, not the stock's full value." ;
    dm:authorityUnread "26 CFR 1.170A-6(c), the grantor lead trust deduction measured as the present value of the income interest; not read. Outside the checks." .

